Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.48,0:00:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Issy, years ago our village was\Nwiped out during a monster attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.88,0:00:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lammis and I are among the few people\Nwho managed to survive the destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.58,0:00:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both of our parents ended up dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.88,0:00:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lammis had her blessing then,\Nbut she was too scared to act.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.18,0:00:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why, to this day, she blames herself\Nfor not being able to save everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no idea Lamas went\Nthrough such an awful ordeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.12,0:00:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's always so cheerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.92,0:00:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once spring comes, the hunters\Nwill become more active again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.76,0:00:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time, I'll protect Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.04,0:00:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.38,0:00:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's freezing out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.14,0:00:50.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really should have\Nput on an extra scarf.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.90,0:00:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that one looks gaudy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.96,0:00:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you even talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.40,0:00:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Red's my lucky color.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.86,0:00:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, there.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.91,0:00:57.82,sign_29945_459_Oden,text,0,0,0,,{\c&H604038&\3c&H352412&}Oden
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.86,0:00:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This stuff always hits the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.88,0:01:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that why you buy the\Nsame thing every day?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.06,0:01:02.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.10,0:01:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I not allowed to have a favorite?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.34,0:01:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Catch you later, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.14,0:01:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.52,0:01:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.76,0:01:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My skin is red and white and pink.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.68,0:01:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm hot because I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.10,0:01:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're my skin, I need\Nyou to worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.50,0:01:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of a sudden, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.08,0:01:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need you to worry about it.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.16,0:01:47.50,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine, {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.76,0:01:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.60,0:01:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I'm ready, let's go?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.56,0:02:52.19,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(98,55)\fad(734,1)\fscx70}The Fighting Vending Machine
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.36,0:02:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For real, I wish you could have been\Nthere to see their faces when it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.72,0:02:54.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.66,0:02:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's funny, I was actually just\Nabout to head over to your shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.94,0:02:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.58,0:03:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to pick up some things,\Nbut I'm going there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.02,0:03:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, I think your scarf\Nis a really pretty color.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.26,0:03:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm partial to red myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.82,0:03:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be a gentleman and help\Nher carry her things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.36,0:03:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.32,0:03:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, you're too nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.60,0:03:23.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here I am again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.20,0:03:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I even made sure to dress\Nup in your favorite color.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.40,0:03:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet all I can do is watch\Nas you walk away. Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.74,0:03:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on? Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.46,0:03:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that some kind of vegetable?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.12,0:03:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying you want me to take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.64,0:03:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.72,0:03:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did these eggs come from?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.29,0:03:55.92,sign_5642_46_THE_KONJAC,text,0,0,0,,THE KONJAC
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.04,0:03:56.67,sign_29945_459_Oden,text,0,0,0,,{\fs30\c&H190903&\3c&H4A3A30&}Fishcake Friends
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.79,0:03:57.54,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text,0,0,0,,{\c&H4F3041&\3c&H644C35&\fs30}Heaven's Stock
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.40,0:03:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.16,0:04:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.26,0:04:03.22,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text,0,0,0,,{\c&H300E5F&\3c&H78645D&\fs30}Heaven's Stock
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.64,0:04:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soup stock, made from flying fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.24,0:04:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.52,0:04:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.18,0:04:15.15,sign_29945_459_Oden,text (top),0,0,0,,{\fs20\i0\c&H6F442B&\3c&H9A7770&\pos(125,20)}The Blessings of Oden\N{\fs40\i1\c&HCFB08F&\3c&H372117&} Oden
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.94,0:04:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to stew all of\Nthese ingredients together?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.14,0:04:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.36,0:04:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.12,0:04:19.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With this, I'll finally\Ncatch his attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.04,0:04:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's super cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.72,0:04:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gorth, Boxxo, love is the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.70,0:04:28.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every day seems to sparkle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.76,0:04:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. Get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.38,0:04:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She cooked me dinner again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.76,0:04:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was so unbelievably good.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.67,0:04:35.67,sign_29945_459_Oden,text,0,0,0,,{\c&H735444&\3c&H462728&}Oden
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.90,0:04:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.81,0:04:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this now, Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.12,0:04:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you giving me one on\Nthe house to celebrate?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.64,0:04:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! It's hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.06,0:04:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you get for bragging.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.28,0:04:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Boxxo, we're back! Hello, there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.96,0:04:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pretty warm today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.60,0:05:01.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we get\Nsomething cold and bubbly?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.18,0:05:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. We're gonna be setting out\Ntomorrow, okay? Hello there! That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.40,0:05:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time sure flies fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.02,0:05:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be traveling with\Nthe Menagerie of Fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.40,0:05:15.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.31,0:05:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They said something about\Nchecking on the crocodile fiends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.12,0:05:20.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crocodile fiends, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.88,0:05:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're one of the three\Nbig monster factions
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.88,0:05:25.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that inhabit the Clearflow Lake stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.60,0:05:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We defeated the frog fiends\Nand the two-headed snakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.32,0:05:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So all we have to do is make sure\Nthe crocodile fiends don't multiply!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.26,0:05:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just going to be a scouting mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.06,0:05:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous to let their\Npopulation grow unchecked.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.40,0:05:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A king frog fiend popped up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.16,0:05:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As well as a giant two-headed snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.02,0:05:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't help but feel something\Nstrange is going on in this stratum?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.40,0:05:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Promise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.31,0:05:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll run away if things get too dicey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.52,0:05:51.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.43,0:05:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo and I'll make a run for\Nit if it's too much, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.12,0:05:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.74,0:05:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.74,0:05:59.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens,\NI'll keep Lamas safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.30,0:06:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, our guest of honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.50,0:06:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.20,0:06:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Lammis and Boxxo! We meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.24,0:06:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a welcome sight.\NBoth of you. Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.64,0:06:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for having us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.16,0:06:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lammis! Boxxo! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.52,0:06:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You be careful out there! We will! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.06,0:06:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to head out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.04,0:06:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two can get on if\Nyou'd like. No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.12,0:06:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll walk if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.86,0:06:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be helpful for my training.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.02,0:06:29.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.93,0:06:32.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That just means there's more room for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.62,0:06:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're coming too, Hulemy? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.86,0:06:37.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an ecology survey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.42,0:06:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll need someone who actually\Nknows what they're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.92,0:06:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, Director Bear\Npractically begged me to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.04,0:06:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did she keep it a secret\Nso she could surprise us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.78,0:06:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, everything should work out fine\Nwith the menagerie of fools here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.76,0:06:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This weather's pretty nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.10,0:06:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm being honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.76,0:06:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not the kind of guy who could spend\Nhis whole life cooped up in a town.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.16,0:07:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll waste away if I don't take\Na breather outside now and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.20,0:07:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.46,0:07:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is anyone else ready for a little break?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.38,0:07:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starving right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.02,0:07:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, thanks for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.78,0:07:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.04,0:07:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't want to just\Nsit here and do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.64,0:07:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I could throw some rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.76,0:07:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.32,0:07:33.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a good way of putting\Nher absurd strength to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.22,0:07:36.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lammis, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.72,0:07:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't this one of those\Nbubbly drinks from Boxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.82,0:07:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the bottle is a lot harder than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.36,0:07:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think he's\Ntelling you to throw it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.26,0:07:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.38,0:07:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that got some serious\Ndistance, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.18,0:07:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.94,0:08:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe we get to eat all\Nthis yummy stuff out on a campaign.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.00,0:08:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're way better than field rations.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.00,0:08:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have Boxxo to thank for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.88,0:08:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as he's here, or we won't need\Nto worry about running out of food.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.60,0:08:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.51,0:08:15.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have to catch monsters\Nand roast them whole anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.00,0:08:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.91,0:08:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy I could cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.42,0:08:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright then, if you'll\Nexcuse me. Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.28,0:08:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have some sort of new\Nfunction you want to show us, Boxo?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.85,0:08:30.11,sign_12129_132_Emergency_Stockp,text,0,0,0,,{\move(90,-5,90,85)\frx28\fry358\fad(1,768)}Emergency\NStockpile
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.60,0:08:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.48,0:08:32.36,sign_12129_132_Emergency_Stockp,text,0,0,0,,{\fs35\c&HE4E0E4&\3c&H38363E&\move(335,115,335,150)\frz-3.95\fax0.06\fad(768,1)}Emergency\N Stockpile
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.90,0:08:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like there's something\Nnew on your side there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.62,0:08:35.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to mention this\Nstrange foldable chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.58,0:08:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the hole in the middle for?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.22,0:08:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this bag fits perfectly\Ninto the hole in the chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.86,0:08:44.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that's left is to\Nfigure out this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.94,0:08:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we have a tent that's just\Nbig enough for one person
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.90,0:08:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and a chair with a hole that perfectly fits\Na bag. Wait a second. Is this a toilet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.34,0:08:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A toilet? Ding, ding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.58,0:08:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a simple toilet\Ninstalled on the sides of
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.68,0:09:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,vending machines to help\Nwith disaster management.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.58,0:09:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.80,0:09:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With this setup, nobody can see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.66,0:09:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And once you're done, you can\Ncleanly dispose of the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.68,0:09:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a clever idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.40,0:09:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I right, Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.96,0:09:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.76,0:09:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.98,0:09:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ain't I a genius?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.12,0:09:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't convinced\NBoxo to come with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.44,0:09:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you wouldn't have had\Nall these conveniences.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.14,0:09:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, tell me how wonderful I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.16,0:09:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't get to steal Boxo's credit,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.98,0:09:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and frankly, it's disgusting\Nyou'd even consider it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.58,0:09:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.66,0:09:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're entering monster territory now,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.78,0:09:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you guys better stay\Non guard for any danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.28,0:09:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you should keep watch too, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.30,0:09:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.21,0:09:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should poke\Nhim with a spear. Silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.00,0:09:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He deserves it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.40,0:09:49.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you come down, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.40,0:09:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd like to discuss our\Nplans for how to proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.48,0:09:54.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, if you insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.84,0:09:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Aka, Shiro, you\Ntwo scout the area. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.50,0:10:00.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, we'll get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.92,0:10:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wants them to handle recon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.70,0:10:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By all appearances,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.96,0:10:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they look to be more like the life of\Nthe party than responsible party members.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.92,0:10:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess that goes to show you shouldn't\Njudge people by how they look.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.64,0:10:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Might as well kick our feet\Nback while we wait for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.00,0:10:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo, you got any tasty snacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.32,0:10:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like some sweetened tea, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.30,0:10:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.68,0:10:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're back, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.30,0:10:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You miss us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.66,0:10:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good work, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.42,0:10:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a break, then let's hear your report.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.78,0:10:36.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.94,0:10:40.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.96,0:10:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it was about two hours\Nnortheast of here, right, Aka?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.96,0:10:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's exactly right, Shiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.48,0:10:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found a small marsh with nearly\N30 of them splashing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.56,0:10:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,30 of them, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.98,0:10:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How big do groups of these\Nfiends typically get?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.70,0:10:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They number from 10 to 50 at the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.30,0:10:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd say 30 makes it an average group.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.04,0:11:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How tall would you say they were?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.74,0:11:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me think.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.18,0:11:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On their hind legs, maybe\Nabout as tall as us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.24,0:11:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, give or take a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.54,0:11:09.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's smaller than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.34,0:11:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have they been short on food since they\Ncan no longer attack the frog fiends?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.48,0:11:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I thought the\Ncrocodile fiends were the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.64,0:11:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,most vicious of the three\Nmajor monster factions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.50,0:11:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the frog fiend population's\Nbeen increasing lately,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.54,0:11:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wouldn't they be happy since it means\Nthey could more easily fill their bellies?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.30,0:11:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's because of the king frog\Nfiend that recently popped up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.40,0:11:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In addition to being absurdly powerful in\Nbattle, they're also exceptional leaders.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.48,0:11:36.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Small groups and lone wolves\Nalike tend to gather to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.46,0:11:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No wonder we had to be so\Ncareful in dealing with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.62,0:11:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's not a big group, I don't\Nsee why we can't just leave them be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.24,0:11:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, need I remind you\Nthat they're carnivorous?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.30,0:11:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think they'll do to satisfy\Ntheir hunger? Right. Humans, huh? Dang. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.04,0:11:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, though, the purpose of this\Nmission was to gather information.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.64,0:11:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't go out of\Nour way to kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.92,0:12:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Crocodile Fiend\Nmaterials fetch a high price.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.72,0:12:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's our chance while\Nthey're all starving and weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.14,0:12:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Vice Captain completely\Nchanges whenever money's involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.50,0:12:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's usually so\Nlevel-headed about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.52,0:12:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know Vice Captain\NFilmina was that kind of person.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.04,0:12:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, just look at her captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.10,0:12:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet they're always short on money.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.64,0:12:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, then we'll go put them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.84,0:12:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll launch our attack in\Nthe middle of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.06,0:12:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'd advise against that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.52,0:12:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crocodile fiends are nocturnal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.22,0:12:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're more ferocious at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.08,0:12:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.16,0:12:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are on the same page.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.52,0:12:36.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.43,0:12:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want everyone to get plenty of rest\Ntonight, and we'll move out in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.76,0:12:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.30,0:12:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.48,0:12:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once the fighting starts,\NI'll have nothing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.36,0:12:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas, don't do anything risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.32,0:13:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you, if things get\Nbad, protect Lamas for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.96,0:13:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.24,0:13:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got my back? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.90,0:13:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could do more to\Nassist you during the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.40,0:13:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been racking my brain\Nfor ways I could help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.44,0:13:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up, Boxo?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:15.02,0:13:19.61,sign_19062_231_Automatic_Ice_Ma,text (middle),0,0,0,,{\fad(191,1)}Automatic Ice {\3c&HDDB99B&}Machine\N\N{\fs10}For inquires, contact \NIceberg Ice Machines, Inc.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.68,0:13:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You changed up the way you look again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.84,0:13:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.75,0:13:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.32,0:13:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean this is ice?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.90,0:13:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why would Voxo spit\Nout these cubes of ice?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.02,0:13:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think he's telling us to\Nuse it in the crocodile hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.98,0:13:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.89,0:13:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.06,0:13:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see, but you'd have to be able\Nto dispense a ton of ice at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.54,0:13:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.92,0:13:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, that's good to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.78,0:13:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow's battle is gonna be interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.06,0:13:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could even win a reward!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.62,0:13:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hulemy, you're not making sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.56,0:13:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me so I understand, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.74,0:13:57.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.20,0:14:00.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The crocodile fiends\Nhave finally come ashore!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.12,0:14:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were shivering like they were cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.64,0:14:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.70,0:14:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems everything's going\Naccording to plan. And now,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.38,0:14:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll need a way to obstruct our view so\Nwe can get closer without being noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.70,0:14:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Covering the whole marsh with\Nfog magic will be too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.04,0:14:17.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if that's a no-go,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.84,0:14:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,maybe we could try\Nspreading them into groups?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.94,0:14:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on, Boxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.08,0:14:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's new.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.12,0:14:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of shape is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.76,0:14:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.92,0:14:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too cloudy to be ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.94,0:14:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you making a new type\Nof hardened snow? Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.36,0:14:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, I think maybe he's\Ntrying to say don't touch that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.32,0:14:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it's dangerous to\Ntouch it without protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.58,0:14:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.78,0:14:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.96,0:14:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.26,0:14:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That stuff's creating a bunch of fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.12,0:14:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just full of surprises, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.30,0:14:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we combine this with my magic, we\Ncan obscure the entire area with fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.72,0:15:00.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a really clever idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.68,0:15:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew I'd pick the right\Nmagic item for this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.28,0:15:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're trying to steal\Ncredit again, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.68,0:15:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, stop your moping\Nand give us our orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.36,0:15:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just go and pick them off one by\None like we discussed last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.64,0:15:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your useless Captain's gonna\Nsit here and help himself
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.92,0:15:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to sweeten tea while you deal\Nwith the crocodile fiends.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.90,0:15:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, uh, I kind of want to go, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.84,0:15:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Voxo has to stay and keep dumping\Nthat stuff to keep the fog going.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.32,0:15:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you guys be okay without me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.30,0:15:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.62,0:15:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, we'll both be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.74,0:15:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm actually more worried\Nabout you out there. Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.02,0:15:39.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.93,0:15:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be back before you know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.54,0:15:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.52,0:15:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, everyone in the Menagerie\Nof Fools is an experienced hunter,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.10,0:15:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I highly doubt they'll\Ndo anything too reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.24,0:15:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This works out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.22,0:15:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to talk to you for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.44,0:15:54.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.72,0:15:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I said before, Director Bear\Nasked me to come along with you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.84,0:16:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But my mission's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.58,0:16:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wanted me to try to\Nfigure out why things have
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.82,0:16:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,started to go awry in the\NClearflow Lake Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.82,0:16:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if you know this or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.82,0:16:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but in each stratum there\Nexists a being called a lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.18,0:16:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They appear only on rare occasions,\Nand nobody knows what triggers it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.08,0:16:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Years or even decades can\Npass between sightings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.22,0:16:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be the dungeon boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.22,0:16:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kind of like the ones\Nyou see in a video game.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.18,0:16:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.14,0:16:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seems the director thinks these disturbances\Nmight be caused by the Lord's revival.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.48,0:16:30.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.76,0:16:34.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you know there's a rumor that\Nif you manage to defeat a Lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.30,0:16:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll be bestowed with\Nan incredible treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.78,0:16:41.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, even if it is true, there's no way\Nwe could take down the Lord of Estratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.10,0:16:43.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.01,0:16:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.54,0:16:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.96,0:16:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.38,0:17:00.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Lord's actually here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.06,0:17:03.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.08,0:17:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like there's even stratum split.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.26,0:17:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.84,0:17:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never heard that phrase, but I can\Ntell right away it's something really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.78,0:17:12.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's Lama?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.72,0:17:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's in the back, knocked down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.34,0:17:15.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.30,0:17:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drop all of my hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.88,0:17:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what about Voxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.42,0:17:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna leave him behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.60,0:17:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.51,0:17:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.04,0:17:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.20,0:17:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll come back for you, I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.42,0:17:32.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get your damn hands off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.04,0:17:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.98,0:17:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.40,0:17:38.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.31,0:17:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Form change!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.78,0:17:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raise durability by 100 to 200,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.22,0:17:53.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,raise toughness by 30 to 50, though it\Nmight not be enough to make a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.56,0:18:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Points reduced by 1,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.84,0:18:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,1,000?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.08,0:18:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I get hit with an attack stronger than\Nthe barrier, it uses up a ton of points.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.46,0:18:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that thing hit me directly, I\Nwould have been turned into scrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.26,0:18:14.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's all the more reason I can't\Nlet this big guy go after the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.34,0:18:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll use the barrier to expel\Nthese fried chicken lunches.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.62,0:18:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.53,0:18:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems it likes them.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:31.25,0:18:37.63,sign_29945_459_Oden,text,0,0,0,,{\fs20\c&HA79081&\3c&HD4CABC&}Deep-Fried Chicken
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.70,0:18:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, eat on up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.14,0:18:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll feed you until you explode!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.70,0:18:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.60,0:18:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.42,0:19:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This has to be its stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.44,0:19:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, my points are dropping like crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.52,0:19:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means I don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.38,0:19:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I better get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.08,0:19:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll create as much chaos as possible.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:12.50,0:19:14.04,sign_19062_231_Automatic_Ice_Ma,text,0,0,0,,{\c&HA46472&\3c&HC7B9CC&}Completely gets rid \Nof any and all stains
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.22,0:19:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Barrier ejection time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.52,0:19:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at those babies fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.74,0:19:23.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give your stomach a good cleansing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.12,0:19:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I guess that means it's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.26,0:19:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad it'll only give it a stomach ache.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.20,0:19:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't finish it off like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.74,0:19:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's try one of those old gas vending\Nmachines you'd sometimes see around old ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.18,0:19:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got an idea that might work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.94,0:19:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, I'll fill the barrier with gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.26,0:19:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, when the pressure's built\Nup, I'll let it escape all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.10,0:19:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to make a fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.82,0:19:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll change into a model that has\Nthe ability to warm up frozen food.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:59.17,0:20:00.34,sign_28752_345_Imagawayaki,text (left),0,0,0,,{\move(133,119,135,0)}Imagawayaki
Dialogue: 1,0:19:59.17,0:20:00.34,sign_28752_345_Imagawayaki,text (middle),0,0,0,,{\move(355,119,357,0)\fsp4.5}Yakisoba
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.64,0:20:03.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, restock an item directly\Ninto my internal microwave.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.86,0:20:05.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I've never tried to do\Nsomething like that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.82,0:20:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not even sure I can\Nactually pull it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.18,0:20:09.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This bending machine is my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.72,0:20:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I've had months to get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.46,0:20:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.84,0:20:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.75,0:20:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.20,0:20:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.80,0:20:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do the same thing with\Na towel and a newspaper.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:21.03,0:20:22.74,sign_1513_19_Kokuuma_Cream_of,text,0,0,0,,{\fs20}Kokuuma Cream of Corn Soup
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.02,0:20:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now the forbidden step.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.10,0:20:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heating up a metal can in a microwave.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.18,0:20:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,10 damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.64,0:20:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Durability has been\Ndecreased by 10. Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.66,0:20:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll use the barrier to toss\Nthese items out into the gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.62,0:20:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to your next use.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.82,0:21:07.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Owie!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.30,0:21:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.06,0:21:12.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.18,0:21:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These bones kind of look like\Nthey belong to that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.54,0:21:17.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.42,0:21:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This coin?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.66,0:21:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be the incredible\Ntreasure Hulemy was talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.70,0:21:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might as well take it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.84,0:21:31.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.96,0:21:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap. Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.22,0:21:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this that stratum split thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.38,0:21:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.54,0:21:39.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, someone with the\Nblessing of might, save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.04,0:21:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, you don't have to have a blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.40,0:21:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take anyone strong enough to\Ncarry around a vending machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.20,0:21:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I plunged into the darkness,\Nan image came to my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.74,0:22:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A scene of llamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.82,0:22:03.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crying
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.62,0:22:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.22,0:23:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.01,0:23:40.01,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,upper left text,0,0,0,,{\pos(51,65)\fs14}Next Time
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.01,0:23:40.01,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,lower right text,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs29\pos(400,298)\fscx78}The Voracious Devils
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.24,0:23:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.08,0:23:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.

